{
  "_readme": "The single registry for ALL data. Each entry lists the local file (used when mode is \"files\") and the REST endpoint (used when mode is \"api\"). To integrate a backend: set mode to \"api\", fill apiBase (and headers if needed), and make each endpoint return the same shape as its file. Any entry can override the global mode with \"source\": \"file\" or \"api\".",
